/ A program's "before each goal" hears its app's own goals, never plang's system goals: reading %!goal% runs plang's
/ /system/shortcut/goal.goal, and the call bound before each goal heard only the app's goal before it.
Start
- before each goal, call Log
- call goal Mine
- set %name% = %!goal.name%
- assert %last% equals "Mine"

Mine
- set %x% = 1

Log
- set %last% = %!event!item.name%
